{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56312","headline":"秋渡颍水 · 李斌","name":"秋渡颍水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荡子乘春夜，行歌渡颖川。\n云浮初[蔽]（弊）月，风动乍摇船。\n暗水空流响，惊人信莫前。\n唯闻靡靡曲，砂上叹□捐。\n（均见伯三六一九卷。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李斌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}